[node name="StoryItems" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="AleTap" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(190, -20)
script = ExtResource("7_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the ale tap"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The ale tap[/b]

The ale cask stands on its trestle with the rain butt right beside it, and the dipper hangs on a nail between the two, wet at both ends.

Nobody at the crossing complains. The ale is two copper a cup and tastes of the river either way."
reexamine_text = "The dipper is still wet at both ends."

