[node name="CartersSlate" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(430, -150)
script = ExtResource("7_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the slate"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The carters' slate[/b]

A slate by the stair, chalked in a dozen hands: a carter's mark, a load, a night's lodging owed. GREYSTONE ORE, TWO NIGHTS. WOOL FOR THE CAPITOL, ONE. Some marks have been wiped and chalked again so often the slate has gone grey under them.

At the bottom, in the keeper's square letters: NO TICK PAST THE NEW MOON."
reexamine_text = "The slate is fuller than it was. Someone always owes for a night."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="StoryItems/CartersSlate"]
