[node name="OldRope" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-300, -150)
script = ExtResource("7_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the old rope"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The old ferry rope[/b]

A coil of black, tarred hemp hangs over the hearth on two iron hooks: a length of the great ferry rope, worn through and replaced long ago. The house is named for it.

The tar has gone soft in the heat of the fire, and the whole room smells of it."
reexamine_text = "The tar smell never quite leaves your clothes."

